                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Jonathan Irons could nationalize my fucking organs and I'd ask if he wanted them gift-wrapped.\n\nthis man walks into a room and suddenly i'm forgetting every political belief i've ever held. democracy? human rights? the Geneva Convention? sorry, i'm listening to his voice and experiencing a catastrophic failure of the frontal lobe.\n\nthe exosuits are cool i guess. double jumping is fun. the guns go pew pew. HOWEVER, why does every man in this game look like he could ruin my credit score, emotionally neglect me, and convince me it was character development?\n\ni didn't enlist. i got groomed by a military-industrial complex with excellent cheekbones.\n\n10/10. would defect to a private military corporation and become an international war criminal for a man who calls me “son” with that much bass in his voice.",
